            {
                "entry_id": "5ccd2ac7-d474-31d8-8af4-3f8e31bbeea2",
                "word": "Grad",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "16eb0e92-90fb-43de-8fc6-69e631a92960",
                        "entry_id": "5ccd2ac7-d474-31d8-8af4-3f8e31bbeea2",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "Grads"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5ca38fb0-877d-3bd0-9b93-c7ea2914a0bc",
                        "entry_id": "5ccd2ac7-d474-31d8-8af4-3f8e31bbeea2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A type of Soviet artillery multiple rocket launcher, or a rocket fired by this."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "291fb84e-16bc-4ae9-943c-9228a71eb11b",
                                "sense_id": "5ca38fb0-877d-3bd0-9b93-c7ea2914a0bc",
                                "text": "It supplements the 220 mm BM-22 Uragan (‘Hurricane’) and 122 mm BM-21 Grad (‘Hail’) MRLs, already in service."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "09b749ed-92ad-423e-a3ea-cc2c5aee408e",
                                "sense_id": "5ca38fb0-877d-3bd0-9b93-c7ea2914a0bc",
                                "text": "The MRL systems Smerch, Uragan, and Grad are designed to destroy concentrations of personnel and various vehicles at distances up to 70 kilometers."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e9a01cb3-c092-4a5d-8b20-2428d6bd20eb",
                                "sense_id": "5ca38fb0-877d-3bd0-9b93-c7ea2914a0bc",
                                "text": "The Russians fought back with Grad rocket-launcher salvos and mortar attacks (they also made some use of armor)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cd6d71d9-ba49-4a6a-bc99-b2cc420cce22",
                                "sense_id": "5ca38fb0-877d-3bd0-9b93-c7ea2914a0bc",
                                "text": "“[w]e saw Hamas come and put up rocket launchers and fire. We could tell they were Grads by the sound, which is louder and deeper than that of Qassams.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fedf8a19-3359-46bb-8afd-9993df9c3631",
                        "source_entry_id": "5ccd2ac7-d474-31d8-8af4-3f8e31bbeea2",
                        "source_sense_id": "5ca38fb0-877d-3bd0-9b93-c7ea2914a0bc",
